## 5. KPIs and Success Metrics

### 5.1 ML-Specific Technical Metrics

From [Level Up your ML Craft](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020b9c471b742f3414899397c898d2dd049/pages/5585955478/Level+Up+your+ML+Craft):

| Category | Metrics |
|----------|---------|
| **Classification** | Accuracy, Recall, Precision, F1-Score, AUC-PR, AUC-ROC |
| **Regression** | MSE, RMSE, R-squared |
| **Ranking** | Precision@k, Recall@k, F1@k, NDCG@K, MRR, MAP |
| **Resource Utilization** | CPU usage, Memory usage, Disk I/O, Model size |
| **Reliability** | Latency, Throughput, Error Rate, Availability |
| **Data Quality** | Drift, Freshness, Missing value ratio |
| **Deployment** | E2E cycle time, Deployment Frequency, Code Coverage |

### 5.2 Operational Metrics

From [ML Ops Playbook](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/blog/2025/01/10/4658010200/The+ML+Ops+Playbook+Scaling+Machine+Learning+for+Success) and [ML Observability Success Metrics](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5977515989/ML+Observability+Success+Metrics):

| Metric | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Training Time | Per batch/model, tracked per tenant |
| Inference Time | Real-time latency monitored against SLIs |
| API Response Time | External service latency (direct user-facing impact) |
| Service Reliability | 5xx errors (system failures), 429 errors (rate limiting) |
| Time to Detection (TTD) | How quickly model performance issues identified |
| Time to Resolution (TTR) | Speed of identified issues resolved |
| ML Operational Efficiency | 10-40% improvement targets (from KR scoring) |
| Reduction in TTD of feature quality issues | 20-40% reduction targets |

### 5.3 ML Dev Productivity Metrics

From [Define the ML dev productivity metric](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5349782326/Define+the+ML+dev+productivity+metric):

| Scenario | Metric |
|----------|--------|
| E2E experimentation efficiency | Turnaround time for each new experiment iteration |
| Use case onboarding | Time to run first sample workflow |
| Module dev & debug efficiency | Time to a published module; module reusability |
| Workflow dev | Time to a workable workflow |
| Workflow run failure debug | Time to next successful run |
| Model evaluation | Easy to run evaluation and visualize results |
| Model registration | Time to a validated model package |
